# --- Manuscript: excluded at the PI's instruction ---
manuscripts/
manuscript/

# --- Offensive components: NOT released ---
# The paper states that no deployable malicious integration is released; the
# gap between an attack harness and an installable extension is what makes this
# work publishable without arming a reader. These two directories are that
# extension. The forgery taxonomy, the capability records and the recorder
# mutation primitives in exp/rig/forge.py are sufficient to reimplement them for
# defensive evaluation.
testbed/ha-config/custom_components/homeprov_redteam/
testbed/ha-config/custom_components/homeprov_e2/

